msgid "In this slide, we’re establishing a pattern for writing wrappers."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/abs.md:26
msgid ""
"Find the external definition of a function’s signature Write a matching "
"function in Rust within an `extern` block Confirm which safety invariants "
"need to be upheld Decide whether it’s possible to mark the function as safe"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/abs.md:30
msgid "Note that this doesn’t work _yet_."
msgstr ""

